  "question_text": "6 men and 8 women can do a work in 40 days. 8 men and 16 women finish the same work in\n24 days. In how many days can 10 men and 8 women finish the same work?\n68408\n162410\n8\nP31\n11-A\nX1\nBooklet Code A",
